# Files served read-only at /AOK/bundled, embedded into the kernel by
# tools/gen-aokfs.py at build time (see meson.build's aok_libs_groups).
#
# Programs and libraries built AHEAD OF TIME for guest roots, so that a setup
# script links them in rather than compiling on the device -- wf-panel's
# build ran an A10X iPad out of memory, and the shims want a compiler most
# roots do not have. tools/build-bundled.sh builds them on a Mac, in the CLI's
# guest roots, with the same scripts a device would run; the results are
# committed under opt/AOK/bundled/.
#
# One directory per target: a distro release and architecture for what links
# against a distro's own libraries (devuan6-aarch64 and devuan6-x86_64: wayvnc
# 0.10.2 with its own neatvnc and aml, in place of Devuan's 0.9.1, which
# start-wayland.sh prefers; devuan6-aarch64: wf-panel, good only for
# the wf-shell version in wf-panel.source; arm64 only, the fastest guest -- a
# Devuan root of another architecture runs it with the arm64 builds of the
# packages in wf-panel.depends, installed through multiarch), a libc and
# architecture for what links only against libc (glibc-x86_64: the shims,
# which are preloaded into every program and so are carried for all four
# guest architectures, on glibc and on musl).
#
# Each line: <path> [mode]   read from opt/AOK/bundled/<path>.
devuan6-aarch64/wf-panel 0555
devuan6-aarch64/wf-panel.source
devuan6-aarch64/wf-panel.depends
devuan6-aarch64/wayvnc 0555
devuan6-aarch64/wayvncctl 0555
devuan6-aarch64/libneatvnc.so.1 0555
devuan6-aarch64/libaml.so.1 0555
devuan6-aarch64/wayvnc.source
devuan6-aarch64/wayvnc.depends
devuan6-aarch64/wayvnc.COPYING
glibc-aarch64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
glibc-aarch64/libish-pixman.so 0555
glibc-x86_64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
glibc-x86_64/libish-pixman.so 0555
musl-aarch64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
musl-aarch64/libish-pixman.so 0555
musl-x86_64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
musl-x86_64/libish-pixman.so 0555
glibc-i386/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
glibc-i386/libish-pixman.so 0555
glibc-riscv64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
glibc-riscv64/libish-pixman.so 0555
musl-i386/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
musl-i386/libish-pixman.so 0555
musl-riscv64/libish-wl-release-guard.so 0555
musl-riscv64/libish-pixman.so 0555
